  "pages": [
    {
      "name": "Intro",
      "elements": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "x": 144,
          "y": 68,
          "w": 346,
          "h": 36,
          "text": "STATION TRADE COMMISSION",
          "translations": {
            "zh-Hans": "空间站贸易委员会",
            "zh": "空间站贸易委员会"
          },
          "style": "header",
          "fontSize": 22,
          "align": "center",
          "wrap": false,
          "color": "#35526F",
          "id": "header"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "x": 56,
          "y": 100,
          "w": 524,
          "h": 46,
          "text": "Cybernetic Knuckle Appraisal Guide",
          "translations": {
            "zh-Hans": "仿生指节鉴定指南",
            "zh": "仿生指节鉴定指南"
          },
          "style": "title",
          "fontSize": 24,
          "align": "center",
          "wrap": false,
          "color": "#35526F",
          "id": "title"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "x": 70,
          "y": 166,
          "w": 506,
          "h": 100,
          "text": "Cybernetic knuckles are many and their prices vary widely. This guide helps fix a fair market value\nfor any of them.\n\nEvery knuckle starts at 85¢. Shell material, condition and interface marking all move the figure, but\nwhatever its state a knuckle is never worth less than 35¢.",
          "translations": {
            "zh-Hans": "空间站上的仿生指节种类繁多，价格也千差万别。本指南将帮助确定任何仿生指节的公平市场价值。\n\n所有仿生指节的初始价值均为 85¢。材质、品相与接口刻字都会影响其价格。但无论状况如何，仿生指节的最低价值为 35¢。",
            "zh": "空间站上的仿生指节种类繁多，价格也千差万别。本指南将帮助确定任何仿生指节的公平市场价值。\n\n所有仿生指节的初始价值均为 85¢。材质、品相与接口刻字都会影响其价格。但无论状况如何，仿生指节的最低价值为 35¢。"
          },
          "style": "title",
          "fontSize": 15,
          "align": "left",
          "wrap": true,
          "color": "#292234"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "x": 70,
          "y": 286,
          "w": 506,
          "h": 26,
          "text": "Base and floor value",
          "translations": {
            "zh-Hans": "基础价值与最低价值",
            "zh": "基础价值与最低价值"
          },
          "style": "label",
          "fontSize": 18,
          "align": "left",
          "wrap": false,
          "color": "#35526F"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "x": 70,
          "y": 320,
          "w": 506,
          "h": 60,
          "text": "Evaluate the three factors in order, then add them up. Note the floor before arguing the total.",
          "translations": {
            "zh-Hans": "三项按顺序核定后相加。先记底线，再谈总数。",
            "zh": "三项按顺序核定后相加。先记底线，再谈总数。"
          },
          "style": "title",
          "fontSize": 15,
          "align": "left",
          "wrap": true,
          "color": "#292234"
        },
        {
          "type": "image",
          "x": 226,
          "y": 380,
          "w": 176,
          "h": 220,
          "sprite": "ill_iface_emg",
          "fit": "fit"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "x": 114,
          "y": 606,
          "w": 400,
          "h": 20,
          "text": "Steel shell, no wear, EMG marking.",
          "translations": {
            "zh-Hans": "钢壳 · 品相无 · EMG 刻号",
            "zh": "钢壳 · 品相无 · EMG 刻号"
          },
          "style": "caption",
          "fontSize": 15,
          "align": "center",
          "wrap": false,
          "color": "#292234"
        }
      ]
    },
