        {
          "type": "text",
          "x": 70,
          "y": 172,
          "w": 506,
          "h": 26,
          "text": "1. Material",
          "translations": {
            "zh-Hans": "1.材料",
            "zh": "1.材料"
          },
          "style": "label",
          "fontSize": 18,
          "align": "left",
          "wrap": false,
          "color": "#35526F"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "x": 70,
          "y": 204,
          "w": 506,
          "h": 60,
          "text": "Turn the piece in daylight and read the highlight and the grain.",
          "translations": {
            "zh-Hans": "在自然光下转动物件，看高光与表面颗粒。",
            "zh": "在自然光下转动物件，看高光与表面颗粒。"
          },
          "style": "title",
          "fontSize": 15,
          "align": "left",
          "wrap": true,
          "color": "#292234"
        },
        {
          "type": "image",
          "x": 76,
          "y": 236,
          "w": 188,
          "h": 236,
          "sprite": "ill_material_alu",
          "fit": "fit"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "x": 72,
          "y": 480,
          "w": 196,
          "h": 20,
          "text": "Aluminium alloy (+0¢)",
          "translations": {
            "zh-Hans": "铝合金 (+0¢)",
            "zh": "铝合金 (+0¢)"
          },
          "style": "caption",
          "fontSize": 15,
          "align": "center",
          "wrap": false,
          "color": "#292234"
        },
        {
          "type": "image",
          "x": 250,
          "y": 236,
          "w": 188,
          "h": 236,
          "sprite": "ill_material_steel",
          "fit": "fit"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "x": 246,
          "y": 480,
          "w": 196,
          "h": 20,
          "text": "Steel (+30¢)",
          "translations": {
            "zh-Hans": "钢 (+30¢)",
            "zh": "钢 (+30¢)"
          },
          "style": "caption",
          "fontSize": 15,
          "align": "center",
          "wrap": false,
          "color": "#292234"
        },
        {
          "type": "image",
          "x": 424,
          "y": 236,
          "w": 188,
          "h": 236,
          "sprite": "ill_material_gold",
          "fit": "fit"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "x": 420,
          "y": 480,
          "w": 196,
          "h": 20,
          "text": "Gold-plated (+70¢)",
          "translations": {
            "zh-Hans": "镀金 (+70¢)",
            "zh": "镀金 (+70¢)"
          },
          "style": "caption",
          "fontSize": 15,
          "align": "center",
          "wrap": false,
          "color": "#292234"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "x": 70,
          "y": 526,
          "w": 506,
          "h": 110,
          "text": "Aluminium is matte and cold; steel has fine rolled grain and a hard highlight; gold plating is warm\nand fades toward the edges.\n\nThe gap follows processing cost and supply: gold plating was a custom order, so scarcity drives it.\nTurn the piece rather than the lamp: highlights at corners shift with the angle of reflection.",
          "translations": {
            "zh-Hans": "铝合金哑光偏冷；钢有细密轧制纹路、高光硬；镀金偏暖，向边缘渐弱。\n\n价差来自加工成本与存量：镀金原为定制件，溢价主要源于稀有度。读数时应转动物件，而不是移动光源——高光在转角处会因反光角度而失真。",
            "zh": "铝合金哑光偏冷；钢有细密轧制纹路、高光硬；镀金偏暖，向边缘渐弱。\n\n价差来自加工成本与存量：镀金原为定制件，溢价主要源于稀有度。读数时应转动物件，而不是移动光源——高光在转角处会因反光角度而失真。"
          },
          "style": "title",
          "fontSize": 15,
          "align": "left",
          "wrap": true,
          "color": "#292234"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Condition",
      "elements": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "x": 144,
