        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "x": 70,
          "y": 172,
          "w": 506,
          "h": 26,
          "text": "2. Condition",
          "translations": {
            "zh-Hans": "2.品相",
            "zh": "2.品相"
          },
          "style": "label",
          "fontSize": 18,
          "align": "left",
          "wrap": false,
          "color": "#35526F"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "x": 70,
          "y": 204,
          "w": 506,
          "h": 60,
          "text": "Open the joint gap with the magnifier and inspect the pins and the cable run.",
          "translations": {
            "zh-Hans": "用放大镜撑开关节缝隙，检视销钉与走线。",
            "zh": "用放大镜撑开关节缝隙，检视销钉与走线。"
          },
          "style": "title",
          "fontSize": 15,
          "align": "left",
          "wrap": true,
          "color": "#292234"
        },
        {
          "type": "image",
          "x": 76,
          "y": 236,
          "w": 188,
          "h": 236,
          "sprite": "ill_condition_normal",
          "fit": "fit"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "x": 72,
          "y": 480,
          "w": 196,
          "h": 20,
          "text": "None (+0¢)",
          "translations": {
            "zh-Hans": "无 (+0¢)",
            "zh": "无 (+0¢)"
          },
          "style": "caption",
          "fontSize": 15,
          "align": "center",
          "wrap": false,
          "color": "#292234"
        },
        {
          "type": "image",
          "x": 250,
          "y": 236,
          "w": 188,
          "h": 236,
          "sprite": "ill_condition_wear",
          "fit": "fit"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "x": 246,
          "y": 480,
          "w": 196,
          "h": 20,
          "text": "Worn (-25¢)",
          "translations": {
            "zh-Hans": "磨损 (-25¢)",
            "zh": "磨损 (-25¢)"
          },
          "style": "caption",
          "fontSize": 15,
          "align": "center",
          "wrap": false,
          "color": "#292234"
        },
        {
          "type": "image",
          "x": 424,
          "y": 236,
          "w": 188,
          "h": 236,
          "sprite": "ill_condition_damage",
          "fit": "fit"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "x": 420,
          "y": 480,
          "w": 196,
          "h": 20,
          "text": "Damaged (-50¢)",
          "translations": {
            "zh-Hans": "受损 (-50¢)",
            "zh": "受损 (-50¢)"
          },
          "style": "caption",
          "fontSize": 15,
          "align": "center",
          "wrap": false,
          "color": "#292234"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "x": 70,
          "y": 526,
          "w": 506,
          "h": 110,
          "text": "The knuckle is a double-pin part: the gap is designed clearance. A gap is not looseness; looseness\nis a pin moving in its bore. Exposed cable or restricted travel is damage, and is priced as such; damage is the only grade\nthat affects whether the part still works, so it carries the largest deduction. No solvents inside the gap;\na dry cloth is enough.",
          "translations": {
            "zh-Hans": "指节为双销结构，缝隙是设计预留量：有缝隙不等于松动，判断松动看销钉能否在孔内晃动。走线外露或转动受阻即为受损，按受损一档计价。三档之中，只有受损会影响能否正常使用，故扣减最多。缝隙内不得使用溶剂，干布擦拭即可。",
            "zh": "指节为双销结构，缝隙是设计预留量：有缝隙不等于松动，判断松动看销钉能否在孔内晃动。走线外露或转动受阻即为受损，按受损一档计价。三档之中，只有受损会影响能否正常使用，故扣减最多。缝隙内不得使用溶剂，干布擦拭即可。"
          },
          "style": "title",
          "fontSize": 15,
          "align": "left",
          "wrap": true,
          "color": "#292234"
        }
      ]
    },
