          "color": "#35526F"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "x": 70,
          "y": 204,
          "w": 506,
          "h": 60,
          "text": "Read the plate below the joint; confirm the depth of the cut with the magnifier.",
          "translations": {
            "zh-Hans": "辨认关节下方的铭牌；必要时用放大镜确认刻痕深度。",
            "zh": "辨认关节下方的铭牌；必要时用放大镜确认刻痕深度。"
          },
          "style": "title",
          "fontSize": 15,
          "align": "left",
          "wrap": true,
          "color": "#292234"
        },
        {
          "type": "image",
          "x": 76,
          "y": 236,
          "w": 188,
          "h": 236,
          "sprite": "ill_iface_none",
          "fit": "fit"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "x": 72,
          "y": 480,
          "w": 196,
          "h": 20,
          "text": "Unknown (-15¢)",
          "translations": {
            "zh-Hans": "规格不明 (-15¢)",
            "zh": "规格不明 (-15¢)"
          },
          "style": "caption",
          "fontSize": 15,
          "align": "center",
          "wrap": false,
          "color": "#292234"
        },
        {
          "type": "image",
          "x": 250,
          "y": 236,
          "w": 188,
          "h": 236,
          "sprite": "ill_iface_emg",
          "fit": "fit"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "x": 246,
          "y": 480,
          "w": 196,
          "h": 20,
          "text": "EMG (+0¢)",
          "translations": {
            "zh-Hans": "EMG (+0¢)",
            "zh": "EMG (+0¢)"
          },
          "style": "caption",
          "fontSize": 15,
          "align": "center",
          "wrap": false,
          "color": "#292234"
        },
        {
          "type": "image",
          "x": 424,
          "y": 236,
          "w": 188,
          "h": 236,
          "sprite": "ill_iface_emgplus",
          "fit": "fit"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "x": 420,
          "y": 480,
          "w": 196,
          "h": 20,
          "text": "EMG+ (+15¢)",
          "translations": {
            "zh-Hans": "EMG+ (+15¢)",
            "zh": "EMG+ (+15¢)"
          },
          "style": "caption",
          "fontSize": 15,
          "align": "center",
          "wrap": false,
          "color": "#292234"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "x": 70,
          "y": 526,
          "w": 506,
          "h": 110,
          "text": "Factory marks are cold-struck, leaving a regular squeeze pattern at the bottom of the groove. EMG+ is\nthe factory stamp, EMG the civilian standard; a plate without a mark is priced as unknown. The gap\nbetween EMG and EMG+ reflects compatibility with factory hosts. The plate sits under the shell edge; read it\nin raking light. An unreadable cut is priced as unknown.",
          "translations": {
            "zh-Hans": "原厂刻号为冷冲压成形，槽底留有规则挤压纹。EMG+ 为原厂刻号，EMG 为民用标准刻号；未有刻号者一律按规格不明计价。EMG 与 EMG+ 的差价，来自与原厂主机的兼容程度。铭牌被外壳边缘遮挡，需侧光查看。刻痕过浅或不可辨者，按规格不明处理。",
            "zh": "原厂刻号为冷冲压成形，槽底留有规则挤压纹。EMG+ 为原厂刻号，EMG 为民用标准刻号；未有刻号者一律按规格不明计价。EMG 与 EMG+ 的差价，来自与原厂主机的兼容程度。铭牌被外壳边缘遮挡，需侧光查看。刻痕过浅或不可辨者，按规格不明处理。"
          },
          "style": "title",
          "fontSize": 15,
          "align": "left",
          "wrap": true,
          "color": "#292234"
        }
      ]
    },
